%%body
{
  A single crate sat by the doorway, you... didn't remember that specifically, and somehow it felt off.

    @ Voice "Alright greenhorns, pick up a knife!"

  You did remember that, but you recall there was a table originally, something wasn't right, but you search the crate nonetheless.

  Finding the WME Knife, if you remembered correctly the peacekeeper described it as Weak Material Element, regardless you had the knife.

  And just in time as your HUD finally appeared, a single knife sat on the hotbar and you sighed deeply.

    @ Voice "Alright, strike that dummy!"

  Swinging down with the knife, the dummy seemed to resist your very strikes, the knife chipping and breaking away slowly in the process.

  After dealing some semblance of damage, the peacekeeper chuckled.

    @ Voice "I've seen better at a retirement home, but it'll have to do, move unto the next chamber."

  Yep, you did not mess that annoying guy.
}
%date 2026-08-12
